 Use your hands to move, In this game you can look at yourself in the mirror, Try out a new look, and change your ingame color! Here you can do whatever you like with your friends! in Sheep Land you will never be lonely! To join a lobby, Just enter the game and you will instantly join one! If you cant join one, head over to the server buttons and manually join a server, Upon entering the store, here you will find a variety of cosmetics, Ingame moderators will have special cosmetics, including the Kick hammer, Hotdog cosmetic remover, and the \"funny collision sign\" If you see a rule breaker, head over to the leaderboard to report the rulebreaker.", "short_description": "It's finally here! Be a sheep in VR Hangout with friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/sheepovr/sheep-land-policy/blob/main/README.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sheepo", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://leerickfriday28.wixsite.com/sheepz", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "3266398663574469"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982606_687254759793111_6200728386412469183_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wR_cVk-7BzAQ7kNvwET7WQb&_nc_oc=AdnG